  "details": "I was looking at why VRC wasn't compatible with my fidelityFX recently and it turns out that someone did solve this issue back in 2021, 2 entire years ago, (see here: https://github.com/fholger/openvr_fsr) now while this isn't a guaranteed solution, and I don't blame you guys as this seems like a big undertaking, a wide quantity of users report low or unoptimized performance in worlds leading to people not picking up the game, if vrchat could implement this feature more people could be inclined to get VRC+ and support your team with the money they would have spent on getting a better pc to run this game",
